    rdfs:comment "Unsigned draft, not published. Built by holdout/nanopubs/build-nanopubs.mjs from files under holdout/ that are not yet committed; the resolvable copy of those files is the live sub-dashboard data file linked from the provenance. The creator is the software agent that ran the exam; the key holder's ORCID is added only when that person approves and signs. No assertion template is declared because the published Delphi templates still carry the legacy probknow namespace and this 2.0 record was not created from one. Publishing needs the key owner's approval: test registry first." ;
